05:19.400 --> 05:22.520
Or, oh, here we are, 20K off the loads and you still haven't bought or whatever.

05:22.760 --> 05:24.200
First of all, it's kind of gaslighting anyway.

05:24.520 --> 05:27.980
But second of all, they don't seem to realise that like if you caught the bottom,

05:28.140 --> 05:30.540
if you are up 20K in a couple of weeks, right?

05:30.720 --> 05:32.860
Congratulations, I'm genuinely happy for you, right?

05:33.280 --> 05:35.140
Why do I have to be salty about that?

05:35.400 --> 05:37.240
That is a choice for me to be like,

05:37.240 --> 05:41.000
