05:52.140 --> 05:53.500
That's why it means so much to them.

05:53.540 --> 05:54.740
That's why they make it so personal.

05:55.120 --> 05:56.280
So hear what I'm saying.

05:56.480 --> 05:57.320
Try to learn from it.

05:57.380 --> 05:59.240
